@Superbass_HostAddress = http://localhost:5237

### 1. Get User Conversations
GET {{Superbass_HostAddress}}/api/conversations?userEmail=resident@test.com
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create or Get Conversation with Worker
POST {{Superbass_HostAddress}}/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workerId": 1,
  "residentEmail": "resident@test.com",
  "initialMessage": "Hello! Are you available tomorrow for plumbing repair?"
}

### 3. Get Conversation Details by ID
GET {{Superbass_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/1?userEmail=resident@test.com
Accept: application/json

### 4. Send Message in Conversation (Resident to Worker)
POST {{Superbass_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderEmail": "resident@test.com",
  "senderRole": "Resident",
  "messageType": "Text",
  "content": "Can you check the kitchen sink leak?"
}

### 5. Send Message in Conversation (Worker to Resident)
POST {{Superbass_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderEmail": "worker@test.com",
  "senderRole": "Worker",
  "messageType": "Text",
  "content": "Sure, I can come by at 10:00 AM tomorrow."
}

### 6. Get Message History (Paged)
GET {{Superbass_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/1/messages?userEmail=resident@test.com&page=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json

### 7. Mark Conversation Messages as Read
PUT {{Superbass_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/1/read
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "readerEmail": "resident@test.com"
}

### 8. Get Total Unread Messages Count
GET {{Superbass_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/unread-count?userEmail=resident@test.com
Accept: application/json
